WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.661
My friends loved the treasure hunt.

2
00:00:03.662 --> 00:00:08.342
Bada was screaming with joy when he found a treasure.

3
00:00:08.343 --> 00:00:13.461
Why don't you try it on your birthday?

4
00:00:13.462 --> 00:00:16.907
Friend 1: Hana, I had a good time.

5
00:00:16.908 --> 00:00:20.737
Friend 2: Yeah! The treasure hunt was great.

6
00:00:20.738 --> 00:00:27.015
Hana: I am glad you guys liked

7
00:00:27.016 --> 00:00:29.789
it. Everyone: Thank you, Mrs.

8
00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:32.335
Kang! Mom: Thank you, everyone, for

9
00:00:32.336 --> 00:00:34.756
coming. Everyone: Bye,

10
00:00:34.757 --> 00:00:39.393
Hana. Hana: Bye! See you on

11
00:00:39.394 --> 00:00:47.796
Monday. Whew, the party was fun and the food was great. Thanks, Mom.

12
00:00:47.797 --> 00:00:52.655
Mom: You are very welcome.

13
00:00:52.656 --> 00:00:55.437
Bada : Hana, look what I

14
00:00:55.438 --> 00:00:57.478
found! Hana: Good for you,

15
00:00:57.479 --> 00:00:59.059
Bada. You can keep it.

16
00:00:59.060 --> 00:01:04.259
Bada: All right! Hana, can we do the treasure hunt again?

17
00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:08.940
Hana: If you behave and do what I say.

18
00:01:08.941 --> 00:01:11.008
Bada: I can do

19
00:01:11.009 --> 00:01:13.870
that. Hana: Then, we will do it again

20
00:01:13.871 --> 00:01:17.671
tomorrow. For now, you must help Mom clear the table.

21
00:01:17.672 --> 00:01:20.827
Bada: Yes, Ma'am!

22
00:01:20.828 --> 00:01:24.375
Bada behaved and did what I told him.

23
00:01:24.376 --> 00:01:28.542
The next day, we did the treasure hunt again.

24
00:01:28.543 --> 00:01:32.266
It was really fun!

